// Canonical source: a method marked get reads as a property, with no
// parentheses, as the thesis's container-Rule sample reads m_strName.HashCode
// (companion source-samples, container-Rule.bml line 52).
// Answer: 12 (5 + 7).
class Name : Object { section [public] { int HashCode() [get] { return 5; } } }
class Item : Object { section [public] { Name n; Item() { this.n = new Name(); } int HashCode() [get] { return this.n.HashCode + 7; } } }
Item i = new Item();
return i.HashCode;
